The Gi\* statistic map displays positive values (blue, 2-10) concentrated in multiple clusters across northern, central, and eastern regions, with darker blue indicating stronger spatial clustering of high boarding activity. Scattered negative values (orange, -2 to 0) represent areas with low boarding relative to neighbors, though these are less prominent.

